    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"057d5529-2916-43f5-b670-7db19134ca81\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>List of Tracking Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"99ee7e2f-e138-47ef-bc99-437260bcafb7\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/100139061/Programs+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"100139061\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Programs Display Control</a><p>A patient can be enrolled into one or more programs such as TB, Malaria, HIV, ANC, etc. The programs display control will show all the list of active and inactive programs for a patient.<strong>This control cannot be configured on Visit dashboard.</strong></p></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227756/Flowsheet+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227756\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Flowsheet Control</a><p>It is a tabular control for showing Observations, Lab Tests and Drugs/Prescriptions (for configured concepts) across time, grouped by Visit or Encounter for a particular patient.</p></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114228167/Graph+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114228167\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Graph Control</a><p>Observation Graph Control is configured to display the observations values as a graph against observation date time, age or any other concept for configured number of visits.</p></li></ul>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"12fa8209-6fd4-4f12-8d20-db5632a4a86f\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>List of All Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"536c4073-4f45-4053-9729-0363a8cfd006\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114186103/Clinical+Observation+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114186103\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Clinical Observation Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/102891583/Diagnosis+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"102891583\" data-linked-resource-version=\"29\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Diagnosis Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114186506/Disease+Template+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114186506\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Disease Template Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402388/Forms+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402388\" data-linked-resource-version=\"33\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Forms Display Control</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3505586199/New+Forms+React+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3505586199\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">New Forms React Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3562766355/Print+Forms\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3562766355\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Print Forms</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114188767/Observation+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114188767\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Observation Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402359/Obs+To+Obs+FlowSheet\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402359\" data-linked-resource-version=\"56\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Obs To Obs FlowSheet</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115973098/Show+Hide+Display+Controls+based+on+data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115973098\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Show/Hide Display Controls based on data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/93716500/Custom+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"93716500\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Custom Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/700088324/Appointments+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"700088324\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Appointments Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114217801/Birth+Certificate\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114217801\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Birth Certificate</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/99647502/Patient+Monitoring+Tool\" data-linked-resource-id=\"99647502\" data-linked-resource-version=\"28\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Monitoring Tool</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114204226/In-Patient+Department+IPD+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114204226\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">In-Patient Department (IPD) Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114204313/Admission+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114204313\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Admission Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114204754/Disposition+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114204754\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Disposition Control</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206048/Lab+and+Radiology+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206048\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Lab and Radiology Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206500/Order+Fulfillment+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206500\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Order Fulfillment Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206305/Lab+Order+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206305\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Lab Order Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207086/Radiology+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207086\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Radiology Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206168/Bacteriology+Results+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206168\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bacteriology Results Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206820/PACS+Orders+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206820\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">PACS Orders Control</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207149/Medication+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207149\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Medication Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207300/Chronic+Treatment+Chart+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207300\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Chronic Treatment Chart Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402409/Drug+Order+Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402409\" data-linked-resource-version=\"13\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Drug Order / Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/99123216/Treatment+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"99123216\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114746475/Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114746475\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3152838666/Sending+prescription+to+patients\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3152838666\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Sending prescription to patients</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114218923/Miscellaneous+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114218923\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Miscellaneous Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114219028/Navigation+Links+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114219028\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Navigation Links Control</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227069/Patient+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227069\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227194/Patient+Context+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227194\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Context Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227474/Patient+Profile+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227474\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Profile Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/100139014/Visit+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"100139014\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Visit Control</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227604/Tracking+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227604\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Tracking Controls</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227756/Flowsheet+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227756\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Flowsheet Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/100139061/Programs+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"100139061\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Programs Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114228167/Graph+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114228167\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Graph Control</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
